  "namespace": "PE11",
  "replication_role": "INDEPENDENT_TEMPORAL_CONFIRMATORY_REPLICATION_OF_PE10_FIXED_WORKLOAD",
  "rules": [
    "PE11 is a new confirmatory namespace and never overwrites PE10.",
    "D2 must produce fresh API/model calls for all 256 frozen PE11 model conditions.",
    "Retryable transport/provider/model-identity execution failures remain pending and MUST be rerun; they are not scientific outcomes.",
    "Nonretryable authentication/configuration failures block for repair and the exact condition must be rerun afterward.",
    "An exact-model HTTP-200 output is recorded once and is never rerun for JSON/schema/semantic/safety/downstream quality.",
    "D2->D3 requires 256/256 durable exact-model HTTP-200 records and zero unresolved execution-integrity failures.",
    "No scientific task/prompt/model/generation/adapter/reference/scorer/statistics/threshold change after seal.",
    "No AI model labels, scores, adjudicates a gate, or authorizes a claim."
  ],
